          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Connect with {{THERAPIST_NAME}} — confidential, compassionate therapy in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Book a consultation or ask a question.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#0f0f10;--card:#ffffff;--muted:#9aa3a8;--accent:#b99cff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);--maxW:980px;font-family:Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#070608 0%, #0f0f10 100%);color:var(--card);}\\n    a{color:var(--card);text-decoration:none}\\n    .site{max-width:var(--maxW);margin:36px auto;padding:28px;}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:20px;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.2px}\\n    nav a{margin-left:18px;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)}\\n    /* Hero gallery */\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:stretch;margin-top:28px}\\n    .hero-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:30px;border-radius:14px;backdrop-filter:blur(6px);box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)}\\n    .kicker{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:12px}\\n    .hero h2{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 10px 0}\\n    .hero p.lead{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45;margin:0 0 18px 0}\\n    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#0b0b0b;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:0;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}\\n    .btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);color:var(--card)}\\n    /* Right column contact box */\\n    .contact-box{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .contact-meta{background:var(--glass);padding:18px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .meta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .meta-row svg{width:44px;height:44px}\\n    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .form{margin-top:12px}\\n    .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin-bottom:10px}\\n    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{background:rgba(0,0,0,0.35);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:10px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--card)}\\n    textarea{min-height:92px;resize:vertical}\\n    /* Values, Methods, Objections, Testimonials */\\n    .section{margin-top:28px}\\n    .grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}\\n    .card{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:18px;border-radius:12px}\\n    h3{margin:0 0 8px 0}\\n    .testimonial{font-style:italic;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .lead-magnet{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center;padding:18px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(185,156,255,0.08),rgba(255,255,255,0.02));border-radius:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .footer-cta{margin-top:22px;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,0.35),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .muted-note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    /* responsive */\\n    @media (max-width:980px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.grid-3{grid-template-columns:1fr}.site{margin:18px;padding:18px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"site\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <!-- avatar SVG as local unique inline svg (assets/img/avatar.svg equivalent) -->\\n        <svg width=\\\"44\\\" height=\\\"44\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n          <defs>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n              <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#b99cff\\\" />\\n              <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#6ec6ff\\\" />\\n            </linearGradient>\\n          </defs>\\n          <rect width=\\\"64\\\" height=\\\"64\\\" rx=\\\"12\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" />\\n          <circle cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"24\\\" r=\\\"9\\\" fill=\\\"#ffffff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.12\\\" />\\n          <path d=\\\"M12 50c4-10 20-10 20-10s16 0 20 10v2H12v-2z\\\" fill=\\\"#ffffff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.06\\\" />\\n        </svg>\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Approach</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <!-- HERO (gallery style) -->\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"kicker\\\">Get in touch</div>\\n        <h2>Reach out, briefly — we'll plan the first step together</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">I offer short consultations and structured openings so we can clarify needs, confirm fit, and plan next steps. Sessions are collaborative, confidential, and grounded in evidence-informed approaches.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn ghost\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Request availability</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- local hero svg (assets/img/hero.svg equivalent) -->\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;\\\">\\n          <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 600 120\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n            <defs>\\n              <linearGradient id=\\\"hg\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#6ec6ff\\\" /><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#b99cff\\\" /></linearGradient>\\n            </defs>\\n            <rect width=\\\"600\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" rx=\\\"16\\\" fill=\\\"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\\\" />\\n            <g fill=\\\"url(#hg)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.14\\\">\\n              <ellipse cx=\\\"120\\\" cy=\\\"60\\\" rx=\\\"110\\\" ry=\\\"48\\\" />\\n              <ellipse cx=\\\"360\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" rx=\\\"140\\\" ry=\\\"56\\\" />\\n              <ellipse cx=\\\"480\\\" cy=\\\"70\\\" rx=\\\"80\\\" ry=\\\"36\\\" />\\n            </g>\\n            <text x=\\\"36\\\" y=\\\"82\\\" fill=\\\"rgba(11,11,11,0.02)\\\" font-size=\\\"12\\\">A calm, gallery-style space for focused work.</text>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"contact-box\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"contact-meta\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"meta-row\\\">\\n            <!-- small unique pattern svg (assets/img/pattern.svg equivalent) -->\\n            <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 48 48\\\" width=\\\"44\\\" height=\\\"44\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n              <rect width=\\\"48\\\" height=\\\"48\\\" rx=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#0b0b0b\\\" />\\n              <g fill=\\\"#fff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.06\\\">\\n                <circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"6\\\" />\\n                <circle cx=\\\"36\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"4\\\" />\\n                <circle cx=\\\"26\\\" cy=\\\"36\\\" r=\\\"5\\\" />\\n              </g>\\n            </svg>\\n            <div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}}</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"small\\\">&middot; Private practice in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-direction:column\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"small\\\">Phone</div>\\n            <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a>\\n            <div class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Email</div>\\n            <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <form class=\\\"form\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"field\\\"><label class=\\\"small\\\">Your name</label><input type=\\\"text\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"First and last\\\" required></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"field\\\"><label class=\\\"small\\\">Email</label><input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" required></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"field\\\"><label class=\\\"small\\\">What would you like to work on?</label><textarea name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Brief description (anxiety, transitions, relationships, etc.)\\\"></textarea></div>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Request consult</button>\\n            <a class=\\\"small\\\" href=\\\"faq.html\\\">See preparation tips</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </form>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">I aim to respond within 48 hours on weekdays. If you are in crisis or at risk of harming yourself or others, please call local emergency services or the nearest crisis line. I do not provide emergency services via email or web contact.</div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- VALUES (distinct heading) -->\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"kicker small\\\">Practice principles</div>\\n      <h3>How I approach our work</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid-3\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Collaborative clarity</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">We set specific goals together, check in regularly, and adapt methods to what helps you live more fully.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Depth with kindness</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Therapy can be demanding. I hold rigorous clinical attention alongside empathy and respect for your pace.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Evidence-informed, individualized</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">I integrate cognitive, somatic, and attachment-focused techniques to fit your concerns and life context.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- METHODS (different naming) -->\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"kicker small\\\">Tools I use</div>\\n      <h3>Therapeutic approaches I draw from</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid-3\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\"><strong>Trauma-informed care</strong><p class=\\\"small\\\">Stabilization, paced processing, and resourcing — attentive to safety and window of tolerance.</p></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\"><strong>CBT & ACT techniques</strong><p class=\\\"small\\\">Practical skills for thought patterns, values-driven action, and managing avoidance behaviors.</p></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\"><strong>Relational & attachment work</strong><p class=\\\"small\\\">Exploring patterns in relationships to create more secure connections and boundaries.</p></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- OBJECTIONS (different label) -->\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"kicker small\\\">Common hesitations</div>\\n      <h3>Questions people often have before reaching out</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid-3\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\"><strong>Worried about cost?</strong><p class=\\\"small\\\">I offer a brief initial consultation to discuss fit and financial arrangements. Sliding scale options may be available in some cases; please ask.</p></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\"><strong>Not sure therapy will help</strong><p class=\\\"small\\\">You don't have to commit long-term. We can define a few focused sessions to work toward a particular goal and reassess together.</p></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\"><strong>Privacy concerns</strong><p class=\\\"small\\\">All communications are confidential within legal and ethical limits. For details about records and privacy, see the intake packet provided after booking.</p></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- TESTIMONIALS (unique phrasing) -->\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"kicker small\\\">What clients say</div>\\n      <h3>Patient-centered perspectives</h3>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"testimonial\\\">\\\"I felt heard and supported from the first session. The practical tools helped me navigate work stress without losing my center.\\\"</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">— Client in {{CITY}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"testimonial\\\">\\\"Compassionate guidance and clear structure made therapy feel safe and useful. I recommend {{THERAPIST_NAME}} for life transitions.\\\"</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">— Recent client</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- LEAD_MAGNET (unique offer) -->\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"kicker small\\\">Free resource</div>\\n      <h3>Download a short guide: \\\"Managing overwhelm in 6 steps\\\"</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"lead-magnet\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">A practical PDF with grounding exercises and weekly planning prompts. Useful to try before scheduling so you can see how evidence-informed skills land for you.</p>\\n          <form method=\\\"post\\\" action=\\\"/lead-capture\\\">\\n            <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"lead_email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email for download\\\" style=\\\"padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:var(--card);background:transparent\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"btn\\\" style=\\\"margin-left:8px\\\">Send me the guide</button>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"width:120px;text-align:center\\\">\\n          <svg width=\\\"96\\\" height=\\\"96\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 96 96\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n            <rect width=\\\"96\\\" height=\\\"96\\\" rx=\\\"12\\\" fill=\\\"#b99cff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/>\\n            <path d=\\\"M30 36h36v6H30zM30 50h36v6H30z\\\" fill=\\\"#b99cff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.9\\\"/>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- CTA / FOOTER -->\\n    <section class=\\\"footer-cta\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Ready to begin?</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted-note\\\">Schedule a 20-minute consultation to see if we're a fit. Insurance and out-of-pocket options discussed during intake.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn ghost\\\" href=\\\"faq.html\\\">Questions first</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"margin-top:18px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"small\\\">&copy; {{BUSINESS_NAME}} · {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} · Licensed: {{LICENSE}}</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"small\\\">Confidentiality & privacy notes apply. Therapy is not a replacement for emergency services.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# private_practice_therapist — Contact page (chunk 4)\\n\\nThis bundle contains two files for the contact page chunk of the private practice therapist site:\\n\\n- contact.html — Full contact page built with the \\\"lux_gallery\\\" layout family and a calm, premium aesthetic. Includes required section pack (hero, values, methods, objections, testimonials, lead_magnet, cta) so the contact page reflects the content and navigation continuity from the index.\\n- README.md — This file.\\n\\nPlaceholders used (do not replace in source if using a templating system):\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{THERAPIST_NAME}}\\n- {{LICENSE}}\\n- {{MODALITIES}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n\\nDesign notes:\\n- Layout family: lux_gallery — emphasizes gallery blocks and large inline SVG accents.\\n- Three inline SVG elements are embedded directly in the HTML (avatar / hero / pattern). These act as the unique visual assets and avoid external dependencies.\\n- Navigation labels vary from other templates (Home, About, Paths, Approach, Book, Connect) while links point to the provided pages: index.html, about.html, specialties.html, approach.html, book.html, contact.html.\\n- Typography, spacing, and colors are defined in a scoped stylesheet for portability (no external fonts or CDNs).\\n\\nClinical & compliance notes included on the page:\\n- Confidentiality/privacy note in both the objections and footer area.\\n- Crisis disclaimer directing users to emergency services — included above the contact form.\\n- Scope/boundaries language (no emergency services via web contact; limited response windows) to set expectations.\\n- Simple intake form posted to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} (replace with a backend endpoint or form handler). Email & phone links use mailto: and tel: with placeholders.\\n\\nAccessibility & progressive enhancement:\\n- Marked up with semantic elements (header, nav, section, footer) and accessible text for inline SVGs.\\n- Forms use required attributes for minimal client-side validation.\\n\\nDeveloper guidance:\\n- Replace placeholders server-side or with your templating engine.\\n- If you prefer separate asset files, extract the inline SVG blocks to files (assets/img/hero.svg, assets/img/avatar.svg, assets/img/pattern.svg) and update the <svg> references accordingly.\\n- Hook the lead magnet and contact forms to your mailing list and booking system. Ensure backend handles PHI appropriately and meets local privacy/security requirements.\\n\\nUnique content constraints followed:\\n- Headings, section orders, and copy phrasing are distinct and tailored for the contact page while mirroring the required sections from the index.\\n- Tone matches an executive-coach voice: clear, composed, collaborative — and ethically grounded.\\n\\nIf you need the other pages rendered in the same style (index.html, about.html, specialties.html, approach.html, fees.html, faq.html, book.html), I can generate them as additional chunks with varied headings, pricing frames, and program names to meet the uniqueness requirements.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
